# name auster rollback: a server that does not answer after a failed test is sent back to the build before
/^au_update_test() {/,/^}/s/^      au_say "Serving is still build \$now, which it was before the test: .*$/      au_say "\\`auster rollback\\` goes back to what it served before, with no download."/
